---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | {{name}}"
  description="The cookies used on the {{name}} website and how to control them."
>
  <section class="max-w-prose2 mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <p class="kicker mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl mb-8">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-stone2 leading-relaxed">
      <p>This website is a static site and sets no first-party tracking cookies. We do not run advertising or analytics scripts that profile you.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Essential delivery</h2>
      <p>Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may set strictly-necessary cookies to deliver the site securely and protect it from abuse. These cannot be switched off through this site and hold no personal profile information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Controlling cookies</h2>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings at any time. Blocking essential cookies may affect how the site loads.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Questions</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this policy, call us on {{phone}}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
